      1          /**
      2           *  @file
      3           *  @brief      Spi GDM module for MV31x and MKV30x implements the Spi Standard API (Application Programming Interface).
      4           *  @details    This module provides the synchronous serial communication services to the application,
      5           *              such as initialization of Spi module, transmission/reception of byte and multiple bytes
      6           *              via Spi and status of Spi communication.
      7           * <pre>
      8           * The Spi0 is available in the below port pins in MKV3x Controllers
      9           * ------------------------------------------------------         ----------------------------------------
     10           * |                    MKV3x_FAMILY                    |        |              MKV3x_FAMILY             |
     11           * |----------------------------------------------------|        |---------------------------------------|
     12           * |SPI com      | REMAP 0 | REMAP 1 | REMAP 2 |REMAP 3 |        |SPI com     |REMAP 0| REMAP 1 |   NA   |
     13           * |-------------|---------|---------|---------|--------|        |------------|-------|---------|--------|
     14           * |      | MOSI |PORTE 19 |PORTA 16 | PORTC 6 |PORTD 2 |        |     | MOSI |PORTE 1| PORTB 16|PORTD 7 |
     15           * |      |------|---------|---------|---------|--------|        |     |------|-------|---------|--------|
     16           * |      | MISO |PORTE 18 |PORTA 17 | PORTC 7 |PORTD 3 |        |     | MISO |PORTE 3| PORTB 17|PORTD 6 |
     17           * | SPI0 |------|---------|---------|---------|--------|        |SPI1 |------|-------|---------|--------|
     18           * |      | SCK  |PORTE 17 |PORTA 15 | PORTC 5 |PORTD 1 |        |     | SCK  |PORTE 2| PORTB 11|PORTD 5 |
     19           * |      |------|---------|---------|---------|--------|        |     |------|-------|---------|--------|
     20           * |      | PCS0*|PORTE 16 |PORTA 14 | PORTC 4 |PORTD 0 |        |     | PCS0*|PORTE 4| PORTB 10|PORTD 4 |
     21           * |      |------|---------|---------|---------|--------|        |     |------|-------|---------|--------|
     22           * |      | PCS1*|   N/A   |   N/A   | PORTC 3 |PORTD 4 |        |     | PCS1*|PORTE 0| PORTB 9 |  N/A   |
     23           * |      |------|---------|---------|---------|--------|        |     |------|-------|---------|--------|
     24           * |      | PCS2*|   N/A   |   N/A   | PORTC 2 |PORTD 5 |        |     | PCS2*|PORTE 5|   N/A   |  N/A   |
     25           * |      |------|---------|---------|---------|--------|         ---------------------------------------
     26           * |      | PCS3*|   N/A   |   N/A   | PORTC 1 |PORTD 6 |
     27           * |      |------|---------|---------|---------|--------|
     28           * |      | PCS4*|   N/A   |   N/A   | PORTC 0 |  N/A   |
     29           * -----------------------------------------------------
     30           * </pre>
     31           * * PCSx is used only if SPIy_USE_PCSx is enabled
     32           *
     33           *
     34           *  @section    Applicable_Documents
     35           *              Requirement ID - 50717 - https://rm.whirlpool.oncloudone.com/rm/web#action=com.ibm.rdm.web.pages.showArtifact&artifactURI=https%3A%2F%2Frm.whirlpool.oncloudone.com%2Frm%2Fresources%2F_f67yIS8REearGv06AJXz5w&vvc.configuration=https%3A%2F%2Frm.whirlpool.oncloudone.com%2Frm%2Fcm%2Fstream%2F_qZzlsCEkEea1esD_TUzLUg&componentURI=https%3A%2F%2Frm.whirlpool.oncloudone.com%2Frm%2Frm-projects%2F_qYFucSEkEea1esD_TUzLUg%2Fcomponents%2F_qZvUQCEkEea1esD_TUzLUg
